# Copy to .env or .env.local (both gitignored; .env.local wins). Never commit real keys.

# Wallet gibreview signs with. Needed to read bounties and submissions on Gibwork, and it is the wallet that
# pays when gibreview creates bounties itself (gibreview publish, gibreview qa). Bounties made on gibwork.com
# are paid from your Gibwork account's own wallet on the website, never from this one.
# A private key: base58, or a JSON byte array like [12,34,...]. Not a 12/24-word recovery phrase.
SOLANA_PRIVATE_KEY=

# Forces an environment for every command: stage or production. Leave unset for the defaults:
# attach and check use production (where gibwork.com bounties live); publish and qa use stage.
# GIBWORK_ENV=

# Set to 1 to run everything against the offline simulator instead of Gibwork
GIBREVIEW_MOCK=0

# Optional: GitHub token for higher rate limits on pull request checks
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Optional: AI rubric (gibreview score) and the AI test-case writer (gibreview qa generate)
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# GIBREVIEW_AI_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5

# MCP server only
# GIBREVIEW_DIR=/absolute/path/to/project/.gibreview   # review runs here, QA runs in its qa folder
# GIBREVIEW_MCP_ALLOW_PRODUCTION=1   # let agents pay on production (they still need the confirm code)
# GIBREVIEW_MCP_MAX_BUDGET=50        # most escrow one QA run may fund through the MCP server
